Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:29:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Stylus: inject into X server off the UI thread; battery
 prompt from main screen

- Pen hover produces 100+ events/s; XServer.inject* takes the X server lock,
  so doing it on the UI thread could block it (ANR) while the game loads.
  Moves are coalesced and, like button events, applied on a StylusInput thread.
- Ask for the battery-optimization exemption on the main screen instead of
  on game start, so the container is not paused while Wine boots.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018cLUKUNDhFWb9gSFtJ7vW4
